## App colours

Use the App only colours for app-like graphics you design, such as a phone screen in a guide. Do not add them to a dashboard.

Use the accents for small highlights, such as a badge. Accent teal is not the theme's accent colour, which is the household's theme colour.

The 2 dark mode blues are a pair for dark app screens. Dark mode primary blue on Dark mode blue shade 80% has 6.8:1 contrast, so it works for text. The civica theme does not use them, as [Light and dark modes](colour.html#light-and-dark-modes) explains.

### App header

Keep the Primary blue header on key screens, in the app and in a phone browser. It gives each screen a clear, familiar start.

